[line]
[size=4][b]Credits and license[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Tractor Mod[/b] and [b]SMAPI[/b] by [b]Pathoschild[/b] — the original mod this is based on: [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/TractorMod]github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/TractorMod[/url]. Tractor Mod versions before 4.0 by PhthaloBlue. TractorMod Expanded keeps its base: the tractor, garage, summoning, tool attachments, audio and config menu.
[*][b]New in TractorMod Expanded[/b] (by appendriel): the implement system, hitch menu, upgrades at Clint, implement rules, automatic return on dismount, new tractor/garage/implement art, icons, effects, animations and the Item Extensions bridge.
[*]License: MIT. The original copyright notices are kept.
[/list]
